  nonce: f3d5  # f3d5
  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): umbrella of the \"declared field, no producer\" cluster across the schema. Members: INV-nuzal (edge.provenance/quality 100% empty — already linked), WI-lonoz (Edge.quality 100% None — already linked from nuzal), INV-tibob (access_mode 0% on 12/17 edge types), INV-nihug (AnalysisRun.skipped_passes never written by any analyzer). Concrete failures that should populate classification_failures are filed in INV-nuzas (workspace mis-tiered as external_dep). INV-lifik covers the sibling pattern at meta-field level (17 zero-entropy fields). Writer methods exist (limits.py:132-140 add_classification_failure/add_ambiguous_path) with zero producer callers. Fix is a property-test gate: every declared optional channel must be populated by at least one producer when run against a non-trivial fixture, or be annotated `unimplemented` in the schema."  # f3d5
