  new_text: "Pass-27 INV-virik — reserved-empty / missing-field faces (F27.10 stable_id 100% NULL on 8 synthetic kinds + 60% on call_site migrated to WI-libib-bapij per fold-audit Phase 2b; F27.6 and F27.7 retained as INV-virik extensions).\n\nPass-26 F26.9 + F26.14 added the reserved-empty cohort at bm.repo_fingerprint=None top-level + AR.warnings=[] across all 84 ARs. Pass-27 adds two more:\n\n**F27.6: `bm.fingerprint_scheme = None` top-level.** Schema declares the field (parallel to stable_id_scheme='hypergumbo-stableid-v5' and shape_id_scheme='hypergumbo-shapeid-v2' which ARE populated). Producer writes None. Same family as F26.9 (bm.repo_fingerprint=None). Schema declares three scheme-name fields; two populate, one doesn't. Pattern: the third top-level scheme field is the inconsistent one. (Methodological note: pass-30 F30.2 later corrected this finding — the key may actually be absent rather than =None; surface evidence overstated the population gap.)\n\n**F27.7: `bm.toolchain = {}` empty-dict top-level.** Per-AR `toolchain` is populated with detailed runtime info (`{name, version, grammar_module}`); the top-level bm.toolchain is `{}`. Same reserved-empty shape as F26.9, but with dict-typed sentinel. Extends the reserved-empty catalog to include dict-typed reserved-empty (prior catalog: None, '', [] / now adds {}).\n\nCumulative reserved-empty catalog across passes 24/25/26/27 — now ~12 distinct fields/cohorts (excluding the kind-conditioned stable_id pattern, which is consolidated under WI-libib):\n- Reserved-empty top-level scheme: bm.repo_fingerprint=None (F26.9), bm.fingerprint_scheme=None (F27.6)\n- Reserved-empty top-level dict: bm.toolchain={} (F27.7)\n- Reserved-empty AR field: AR.warnings=[] all 84 (F26.14)\n- Reserved-empty Node field — kind-conditioned: origin_run_pass_id=None all 34253 (F25.6); origin_run_id='' on 2228 string-typed (F25.4)\n- Reserved-empty Node nested: node.quality=None (existing)\n- Reserved-empty AR.pass_version='' on 14 (F26.13 / WI-mipul scope)\n- Reserved-empty limits: failed_files=[] / skipped_languages=[] / truncated_files=[] / partial_results_reason='' (F22 / F24.2)\n- Reserved-empty edge: edge.provenance={} all 109915 (existing)\n\nProbe artifact: /tmp/pass27_probe2.py + /tmp/pass27_probe5.py + /tmp/pass27_probe6.py / outputs at /tmp/pass27_output[2,5,6].log.\n\nNo status change; pass-27 enriches reserved-empty catalog."  # c456
  reason: "fold-audit Phase 2b: F27.10 migrated to WI-libib; F27.6+F27.7 kept"  # c456
